OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785917893
OL,3,CVideo shows Russian drone chasing and
OL,4,Cattacking street vendor in Ukraine
OL,6,FIn the Ukrainian town of Kherson, a
OL,7,Fstreet trader selling vegetables was
OL,8,Ftargeted, tracked, and then hit by a
OL,9,Fdrone, as ITV News' Vincent McAviney
OL,10,Freports
OL,12,FUkraine has accused Russia of
OL,13,Fcommitting a war crime after new
OL,14,Ffootage released by police showed a
OL,15,Fdrone chasing and attacking a street
OL,16,Fvendor in the southern city of Kherson.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
