CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785917893
OL,3,CVideo shows Russian drone chasing and
OL,4,Cattacking street vendor in Ukraine
OL,6,FVolodymyr Zelenskyy shared the video,
OL,7,Freleased by police in Kherson, a
OL,8,Ffrontline city just a few miles from
OL,9,Fthe frontline, on Tuesday. It shows
OL,10,Fthe man selling vegetables scrambling
OL,11,Fto escape as a drone circles overhead
OL,12,Fand tracks him before detonating after
OL,13,Fhe dives for cover.
OL,15,FThe man, later identified as 52-year-
OL,16,Fold Yuriy by the city's governor
OL,17,FOleksandr Prokudin, suffered wounds to
OL,18,Fhis back, legs and arms.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785917893
OL,3,CVideo shows Russian drone chasing and
OL,4,Cattacking street vendor in Ukraine
OL,6,F"The world must see this," Zelenskyy
OL,7,Fsaid. "It must see every piece of
OL,8,Fevidence that Russia has gone mad and
OL,9,Fthat its soldiers take pleasure in
OL,10,Fkilling and abusing civilians."
OL,12,FThe Ukrainian president said the
OL,13,FRussian drone deliberately "hunted
OL,14,Fdown" the man, adding that "every
OL,15,Fsingle day, ordinary people in Kherson
OL,16,Fface these Russian 'safaris'."
OL,18,FYuriy, a vegetable vendor from the
OL,19,FMykolaiv region of Ukraine, told the
OL,20,FAssociated Press the ordeal was
OL,21,F"terrifying".
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@ZO]oD@GOUrD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
