PN,31104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785917893
OL,3,CVideo shows Russian drone chasing and
OL,4,Cattacking street vendor in Ukraine
OL,6,F"My wife started running away, and it
OL,7,F(drone) started turning around over
OL,8,Fthe car. I showed him that 'look, it's
OL,9,Fvegetables'. But it started coming at
OL,10,Fme, " he recalled.
OL,12,F"And I was trying to get away while
OL,13,Fshowing - I have nothing here. The
OL,14,Fwife got away, and she started
OL,15,Fscreaming, 'Yura, run!' But where
OL,16,Fwould I run? There's steppe all
OL,17,Faround, there's nowhere to go. To the
OL,18,Fbomb shelter? Didn't even have time to
OL,19,Fthink it over, honestly. Terrifying,
OL,20,Fit really was."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
