PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785917893
OL,3,CVideo shows Russian drone chasing and
OL,4,Cattacking street vendor in Ukraine
OL,6,FRussia's Defence Ministry did not
OL,7,Fimmediately reply to a request for
OL,8,Fcomment by AP, ITV News' US Partner.
OL,10,FUkraine's Foreign Minister Andrii
OL,11,FSybiha said the video showed a
OL,12,F"barbaric war crime".
OL,14,F"This is a deliberate and systemic
OL,15,FRussian strategy. They know exactly
OL,16,Fwhat they are doing. The sadist
OL,17,Foperating this drone knows full well
OL,18,Fthat he is targeting a civilian," he
OL,19,Fwrote on X.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
