PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785917893
OL,3,CVideo shows Russian drone chasing and
OL,4,Cattacking street vendor in Ukraine
OL,6,FKherson's regional mayor, Oleksandr
OL,7,FProkudin, posted a clip of Yuriy
OL,8,Fspeaking from a hospital bed following
OL,9,Fthe attack.
OL,11,FProkudin wrote on X: "For nearly a
OL,12,Fminute, a drone chased the man as he
OL,13,Ftried to escape. Russians clearly saw
OL,14,Fwhom they were attacking, yet still
OL,15,Fdirected the munition at him."
