OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1785917893
OL,3,CVideo shows Russian drone chasing and
OL,4,Cattacking street vendor in Ukraine
OL,6,FDrone attacks on civilians have surged
OL,7,Fsince the war began, with 967 people
OL,8,Fkilled, including ten children, and
OL,9,Fnearly 7,000 people injured, Ukraine's
OL,10,FProsecutor General's Office said
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,13,FThe deployment of remotely-operated
OL,14,Fdrones, sometimes called "human
OL,15,Fsafari", has often been used to track
OL,16,Fand strike civilians going about daily
OL,17,Factivities, according to previous AP
OL,18,Freporting.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
